Files adapted from the game's own code
--------------------------------------

Three files of the optional fast loader (the `fastLoad` setting, off by default) follow the
structure of Oxygen Not Included's own save-loading code closely, method for method, so that a
load spread over many frames does exactly what the game's single load call does, in the same
order:

    OniPerf/Load/Fast/AsyncLoad.cs          the game's SaveLoader and SaveManager load path
    OniPerf/Load/Fast/FastLoadInternal.cs   the game's SaveLoadRoot.LoadInternal
    OniPerf/Load/Fast/FastDeser.cs          the game's KSerialization field deserializer

